	(text "NO I2C PULL-UPS ON THIS BOARD (ICD-01 s3.3): the carrier fits the only 4.7 k pair. A second pair here is an ICD violation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 241.3 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "32eb022a-8472-44db-a11f-fde1cb3db975")
	)
	(text "/FAULT IS OPEN DRAIN AND MUST NEVER BE DRIVEN HIGH. Its only drivers are the thermal sheet's LM339LV open-drain outputs and R207."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 246.38 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f5db8a19-d757-4e9f-a4f3-5e5692a3b88c")
	)
	(text "NO RC FILTER ON PWM0-3 OR /SHUNT0-3 (blocks.md B2): tau <= 14 ns if any network is fitted at all. The reflex 1 k + 100 pF is tau = 100 ns."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 251.46 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "8ddcd535-8bf5-4381-a236-79278720df7f")
	)
	(text "PWM4-7 (J4 7/8/11/12) and DSPI_SCK/MOSI/MISO/CSn (J4 14/15/16/17) are DELIBERATE no-connects - rev A has four channels (decisions.md D2)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 256.54 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "00c6c19a-0163-43af-9190-6d064f1a1023")
	)
	(text "R206 = 4.7 kOhm 1% REQUIRED: ICD-01 s3.4 code 2 (LUM-PAR-A), V_ID = 1.055 V. CR-1 CLOSED - sheets.md's 'VALUE TBD / P4 blocker' is STALE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 261.62 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "26bf0511-5bc4-4d73-aa63-7418258cb775")
	)
	(text "U203 = M24C32 at 0x50: E0/E1/E2 strapped to VSS by R208. WC (pin 7) is ACTIVE HIGH write protect - R209 holds it at VSS so the part is writable."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 266.7 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "7e3a771e-c315-4eab-9fbb-679a1ee3ffca")
	)
	(text "U204 + R210-R213 + C210-C213 + D201-D204 = converter-idle one-shot, DNP OPTION. IF IT IS EVER POPULATED, REMOVE R214-R217."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 271.78 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "d2618bf3-b138-4a01-b7b3-fa02d5270562")
	)
	(text "J4 IS REVERSE-MOUNTED ON THE BOTTOM SIDE, FACING DOWN (ICD s7.3). Pin 1 needs a silkscreen triangle and MUST be checked in the MATED view."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 276.86 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "44b69dcf-e5c1-43f4-95ab-e7af6c13ad1d")
	)
	(text "R218-R221 = 10k /DRV_ENn pull-downs, FITTED. NOT 100k: the TPS92515HV PWM pin sources 25 uA, so 100k rests at 2.5 V and latches the driver ON."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
